nd show how textual data can play a critical role in enhancing the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":223135,"global_rank":156811},{"name":"laurinalastella/Mission-to-Mars","owner":"laurinalastella","html_url":"https://github.com/laurinalastella/Mission-to-Mars","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":223132,"global_rank":156821},{"name":"gothwalritu/Mission-to-Mars","owner":"gothwalritu","html_url":"https://github.com/gothwalritu/Mission-to-Mars","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Web scraping Mars misson data","topics":[],"score":223132,"global_rank":156822},{"name":"mathewvarghesemanu/pokemon_generator","owner":"mathewvarghesemanu","html_url":"https://github.com/mathewvarghesemanu/pokemon_generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Generate new pokemons using GAN","topics":[],"score":223132,"global_rank":156830},{"name":"loganmckerlich/STONK","owner":"loganmckerlich","html_url":"https://github.com/loganmckerlich/STONK","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"the classic ds project where i try to beat meatkat","topics":[],"score":223132,"global_rank":156839},{"name":"younes778/CityU_AI510_PE09","owner":"younes778","html_url":"https://github.com/younes778/CityU_AI510_PE09","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Submission for PE09 for subject AI510 at City University of Seattle","topics":[],"score":223128,"global_rank":156850},{"name":"jbloomlab/ZIKV_DMS_w_Khromykh","owner":"jbloomlab","html_url":"https://github.com/jbloomlab/ZIKV_DMS_w_Khromykh","stars":1,"forks":0,"w